  "title": "Under Armour Appoints Carolyn Everson and Patrick Whitesell to its Board of Directors",
  "summary": "Under Armour, Inc. (NYSE: UA, UAA) today announced the appointment of Carolyn Everson and Patrick Whitesell as members of its Board of Directors effective Feb. 1, 2023. In addition, longtime member Harvey Sanders will retire from Under Armour's Board on March 31, 2023.",
